## 2. Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ App repo pipeline           │   includes template, sets variables only
│  IMAGE_NAME, BUILD_ARGS ... │
└──────────────┬──────────────┘
               │ include (pinned ref v1)
┌──────────────▼──────────────┐
│ ci-templates repo           │   .build-image job definition
│  templates/build-image.yml  │
└──────────────┬──────────────┘
               │ uses image (pinned :1)
┌──────────────▼──────────────┐
│ image-builder repo          │   build-image.sh + Dockerfile + tests
│  → registry/.../builder:1.x │
└──────────────┬──────────────┘
               │ internal detail (replaceable)
┌──────────────▼──────────────┐
│ Backend: BuildKit (today)   │   rootless buildkitd / buildx
└─────────────────────────────┘
```

Three repositories / artifacts:

| Repo | Contains | Consumed as |
|---|---|---|
| `platform/image-builder` | wrapper script, builder Dockerfile, contract tests | container image `registry.company.com/platform/image-builder:<ver>` |
| `platform/ci-templates` | shared GitLab CI job templates | `include:` with pinned `ref:` |
| App repos | only variables + `extends:` | — |

